{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09550","headline":"送皇甫龄宰交河 · 张谓","name":"送皇甫龄宰交河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军帐下来从客，小邑弹琴不易逢。\n楼上胡笳传别怨，尊中腊酒爲谁浓。\n行人醉出双门道，少妇愁看七里烽。\n今日相如轻武骑，多应朝暮客临卭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}